@startuml
' Supporting document: ../references/examples.md#interaction-and-lifecycle-late-payment-authorization
' Scope: expiry during one payment authorization request. Designation: proposed-design, teaching only.
title Initial hypothesis: authorization always confirms
participant Checkout
participant PaymentGateway
participant Reservation
Checkout -> PaymentGateway : authorize()
Reservation -> Reservation : expire()
PaymentGateway --> Checkout : paymentAuthorized
Checkout -> Reservation : confirm()
Reservation --> Checkout : confirmed
note over Checkout, Reservation
  Assumption: late payment revives an expired Reservation.
end note
@enduml
